<title>USA: Ag Services Q2 August 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Ag Services Q2 August 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR FALLS, Iowa 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 1996     1995     1996    1995</p>
